CC fixture capture directory (spec-1.7 R2 D5 T-2.5 CC fixture live capture).
See CAPTURE_SOP.md for capture procedure.

Expected fixture subdirectories (7 per R2 D7 M-5):
- MessagePlain/        — single-line plain text
- MessageMultiline/    — 3-line plain text
- MessageMixedProseFence/ — intro prose + ```go fence (spec-1.6 R-12 关键场景)
- MessageCodeFenceGo/  — fence-only with Go lang
- MessageTruncated/    — Truncated marker "…" + StyleWarning
- MessageContinued/    — Continued marker "…" + StyleDimmed
- MessageEmpty/        — "(no output)" placeholder

Each subdirectory contains:
- input.ansi           — raw ANSI capture from CC session
- golden.png           — reference PNG (freeze rendered or screenshot)
- metadata.json        — capture metadata (cc_version / terminal / cols / rows / theme / font / prompt / sanitizer)
